@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Pay over time with Buy Now, Pay Later - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Buying items";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Pay over time with Buy Now, Pay Later";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_center/pay_over_time_hero.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p>You can use options at checkout to pay over time with Buy Now, Pay Later (BNPL) providers such as Affirm and Klarna.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">When Buy Now, Pay Later is available</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">How to use Buy Now, Pay Later</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Refunds</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">FAQs</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>When Buy Now, Pay Later is available</h2>
        <p>In order for BNPL to be a payment option at checkout, the order must meet certain criteria:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You're using the Lively app on iOS or Android.</li>
            <li>You're purchasing an item using Buy Now.</li>
            <li>The order meets the minimum value.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How to use Buy Now, Pay Later</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Add an item to your cart and proceed to checkout.</li>
            <li>At checkout, under payment options, select your preferred BNPL provider.</li>
            <li>Complete the checkout process.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="text-center my-4">
            <img src="~/help_centre_img/help_center/pay_over_time.png" alt="Buy Now, Pay Later options" class="img-fluid" style="border-radius: 12px;" />
        </div>

        <h2>FAQs</h2>
        <h3>Why don't I see BNPL as an option?</h3>
        <p>If you don't see BNPL as an option, the order might not meet the minimum value requirement or isn't supported in your region.</p>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>8 out of 10 found this helpful</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
